 ploads/event/Broad%20River%20Precinct%2037.1%20information%20organizing%20
 meeting_20260921000706882242.png
DESCRIPTION:An opportunity to learn about candidates\, and information abo
 ut the constitutional amendments on the ballot. Where to vote\, early vote
  and what to do if you encounter issues voting. We are also seeking volunt
 eers to be poll observers. Who should attend: All Broad River Democrats\, 
 Independents\, and others who wish to learn more about Democratic platform
 s and ask questions.
LOCATION:Broad River Community Center (next to Broad River Fire Dept.)\, 4
 4 Broad Riv Volunteer Fire Department Rd\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/buncombedems/event/1040720/
X-SOURCE:Buncombe County Democratic Party
END:VEVENT
